# DSC Live visual honesty

## Climate airflow

- Operator Climate shows **one** CFM surface: Air path map (+ honesty note).
- Do not mount Sankey or Three.js particle scenes on Climate until they resize, balance mass, and survive SPA verify.

## Twin / Ops dash

- Keep `TWIN_SURFACE_GATED` (or equivalent) until Twin WebGL is reliable.
- Prefer an honesty card over a blank canvas.

## Gauges and chips

- Prefer held readings with stale marks over empty theater dials.
- NPK / Rate / Dryback: show value when the bus has a finite metric; otherwise omit or label `· no channel` / `from EC` — never permanent `—` chips that imply a live channel.

## Do not

- Re-enable gated viz for “polish” without Pi screenshot proof.
- Invent CFM or dryback numbers when producers are missing.
